1
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:09,719
Earth,
I know about you and Gun already.

2
00:00:09,719 --> 00:00:13,519
Yes?
Did Gun tell you everything?

3
00:00:13,519 --> 00:00:18,689
Yeah. Once he got drunk,
everything just slipped out.

4
00:00:18,689 --> 00:00:21,680
So what are we buying?

5
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:28,519
Just some essentials—bedsheets, blanket,
pillow, stuff like that.

6
00:00:28,519 --> 00:00:32,279
- Your room doesn't have any?
- How would it? I just moved in.

7
00:00:32,279 --> 00:00:34,079
How are you staying then?

8
00:00:34,079 --> 00:00:39,796
I'm borrowing Tawan's spares for now.
Luckily he has extra stuff.

9
00:00:39,796 --> 00:00:42,000
That's good then.

10
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:46,760
But… you really aren't going back
to stay with Gun, right?

11
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:51,600
I already paid for the room.
I'm not going back.

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,439
What's this, Night?

13
00:01:17,439 --> 00:01:22,411
Your salary. I didn't tell you—
payday is today.

14
00:01:23,506 --> 00:01:30,400
But I worked only a few days…
and I even caused trouble for you.

15
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:34,825
It's fine. Take it. You've got debt
to pay off, don't you?

16
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:38,283
Night, um…

17
00:01:39,748 --> 00:01:42,116
Can I go back to doing the part-time job?

18
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:49,524
You still haven't learned?
Or what is it exactly?

19
00:01:50,568 --> 00:01:52,798
I need to earn money
to pay Gun back.

20
00:01:54,819 --> 00:02:00,509
Keep it. Use it. Don't worry
about Gun's debt too much.

21
00:02:00,846 --> 00:02:02,560
He himself hasn't said a word about it.
